'''Musical''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is orange, which fades into a purple with orange musical notes imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is dark purple, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [http://www.roblox.com/Musical-item?id=365569566 here].

